---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectGuide from '../components/ProjectGuide.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Contacto | Edición Aular 🚀✨"
    description="Ponte en contacto con Edición Aular. Ayudamos a negocios de todos los tamaños a alcanzar sus objetivos. ¡Hablemos de tu proyecto! 📞"
>
    <div class="stg-container">
        <!-- Section: Page Title -->
        <section >
            <div class="stg-row stg-bottom-gap-l">
                <div class="stg-col-6 stg-offset-3 align-center">
                    <h1 class="bringer-page-title" data-appear="fade-up" data-unload="fade-up">Ponte en Contacto</h1>
                    <p class="bringer-large-text" data-appear="fade-up" data-delay="100" data-unload="fade-up">Ayudamos a negocios de todos los tamaños a alcanzar sus objetivos. Creemos que cada marca, grande o pequeña, merece brillar.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bringer-parallax-media" data-parallax-speed="20" data-appear="fade-up" data-delay="200" data-unload="fade-up">
                <img class="bringer-lazy" src="/img/null.png" data-src="/img/contact/contact 1.webp" alt="Get in Touch" width="1920" height="960">
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: About Us -->
        <section>
            <!-- Section Title -->
            <div class="stg-row stg-bottom-gap">
                <div class="stg-col-8">
                    <h2 data-split-appear="fade-up" data-unload="fade-up">¿Listo para encender el fuego de tu marca? 🔥 ¡Conectemos! 🤝</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="stg-col-4"></div>
            </div>
            <!-- Section Content -->
            <div class="stg-row stg-bottom-gap-l">
                <div class="stg-col-6 stg-offset-6" data-appear="fade-up" data-delay="200" data-unload="fade-up">
                    <p>En Edición Aular, creemos en el poder de la colaboración y la pasión compartida. No somos solo un equipo creativo, somos tus socios para encender el potencial único de tu marca. Así que, ya sea que estés repleto de ideas o apenas comenzando a surgir, ¡contáctanos y hablemos!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Grid Gallery -->
            <div class="bringer-grid-3cols bringer-parallax-media bringer-m-grid-3cols stg-m-small-gap" data-stagger-appear="fade-up" data-delay="200" data-stagger-unload="fade-up">
                <a href="/img/inner-pages/contacts02.jpg" class="bringer-lightbox-link" data-size="960x960">
                    <img class="bringer-lazy" src="/img/null.png" data-src="/img/inner-pages/1.webp" alt="Edición Aular" width="960" height="960">
                </a>
                <a href="/img/inner-pages/contacts03.jpg" class="bringer-lightbox-link" data-size="960x960">
                    <img class="bringer-lazy" src="/img/null.png" data-src="/img/inner-pages/brand 4.webp" alt="Edición Aular" width="960" height="960">
                </a>
                <a href="/img/inner-pages/contacts04.jpg" class="bringer-lightbox-link" data-size="960x960">
                    <img class="bringer-lazy" src="/img/null.png" data-src="/img/inner-pages/2.webp" alt="Edición Aular" width="960" height="960">
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: Let's Talk -->
        <section class="backlight-top divider-bottom">
            <!-- Section Title -->
            <div class="stg-row bringer-section-title">
                <div class="stg-col-8 stg-offset-2">
                    <div class="align-center">
                        <h2 data-appear="fade-up" data-unload="fade-up">¡Hablemos! 🗣</h2>
                        <p class="bringer-large-text" data-appear="fade-up" data-delay="100" data-unload="fade-up">Cómo Conectar con Nosotros:</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Contacts Grid -->
            <div class="stg-row" data-stagger-appear="fade-up" data-delay="200" data-stagger-unload="fade-up">
                <div class="stg-col-4 stg-tp-col-6 stg-tp-bottom-gap">
                    <!-- Phone -->
                    <div class="bringer-block stg-aspect-square stg-vertical-space-between">
                        <a href="tel:+573002730128" class="bringer-grid-item-link" aria-label="Llamar a Edición Aular al +57 300 273 0128"></a>
                        <div>
                            <h5>Teléfono<span class="bringer-accent">.</span></h5>
                            <h6>+57 (300) 273-01-28</h6>
                        </div>
                        <p>Llámanos y charla directamente con nuestro amigable equipo. Siempre estamos felices de responder cualquier pregunta.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stg-col-4 stg-tp-col-6 stg-tp-bottom-gap">
                    <!-- Email -->
                    <div class="bringer-block stg-aspect-square stg-vertical-space-between">
                        <a href="mailto:info@edicionaular.com" class="bringer-grid-item-link" aria-label="Enviar un correo a info@edicionaular.com"></a>
                        <div>
                            <h5>Correo<span class="bringer-accent">.</span></h5>
                            <h6>info@edicionaular.com <br> <br>edicionaular@gmail.com</h6>
                        </div>
                        <p>Envíanos un mensaje detallado. Nos pondremos en contacto contigo lo antes posible para discutir tu proyecto creativo.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="stg-col-4 stg-tp-col-12">
                    <!-- Social Media -->
                    <div class="bringer-block stg-aspect-square stg-tp-aspect-rectangle stg-vertical-space-between">
                        <div>
                            <h5>Redes Sociales:<span class="bringer-accent">.</span></h5>
                            <ul class="bringer-socials-list stg-small-gap" data-stagger-appear="fade-up" data-stagger-delay="75">
                                <li>
                                    <a href="https://www.facebook.com/edicionaular" target="_blank" class="bringer-socials-facebook">
                                        <i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/edicion_aular/" target="_blank" class="bringer-socials-instagram">
                                        <i class="fab fa-instagram"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="https://vimeo.com/user67007640" target="_blank" class="bringer-socials-vimeo">
                                        <i class="fab fa-vimeo-v"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@edicionaular8" target="_blank" class="bringer-socials-tiktok">
                                        <i class="fab fa-tiktok"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="https://wa.link/tjepy5" target="_blank" class="bringer-socials-whatsapp">
                                        <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <p>Síguenos en nuestras plataformas sociales para echar un vistazo a nuestro mundo creativo, obtener insights de la industria y conocer nuestros proyectos.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Composición adaptada del CTA bento de home02.html / services.html. -->
        <section id="tu-proyecto" class="contact-project-section" aria-labelledby="contact-project-heading" data-template="home02.html · .bringer-bento-grid.bringer-grid-cta">
            <div class="contact-project-grid">
                <div class="contact-project-intro">
                    <span class="contact-project-eyebrow">Hablemos de lo que viene</span>
                    <h2 id="contact-project-heading">Tu idea merece<br>un buen comienzo<span class="bringer-accent">.</span></h2>
                    <p>Marca, web, contenido o automatización. Cuéntanos qué quieres mejorar y definamos un primer paso.</p>
                </div>
                <button id="orientador-proyecto" type="button" class="contact-project-action contact-guide-trigger" data-open-project-guide aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="project-guide-modal" hidden>
                    <svg class="contact-project-arrow" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" /></svg>
                    <span class="contact-action-meta">Orientador · 3 pasos</span>
                    <span class="contact-action-title">Definir mi proyecto</span>
                </button>
                <a class="contact-project-action contact-call" href="https://cal.com/edicion-aular-website">
                    <svg class="contact-project-arrow" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" /></svg>
                    <span class="contact-action-meta">Elige un horario</span>
                    <span class="contact-action-title">Agendar una llamada</span>
                </a>
                <figure class="contact-project-visual">
                    <img src="/img/ia/agencia-ia.webp" alt="Personas revisando ideas y un mapa de trabajo en un estudio creativo" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    <figcaption><span>Creatividad para alcanzar el éxito</span><a href="/portfolio/">Ver proyectos <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption>
                </figure>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-project-direct">
                <p>¿Prefieres escribirnos directamente?</p>
                <div><a href="https://wa.link/tjepy5">WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="mailto:info@edicionaular.com">Correo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
    <ProjectGuide />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .contact-project-section { scroll-margin-top: 110px; }
    .contact-project-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) repeat(2, minmax(0, .55fr));
        grid-template-areas: "visual intro intro" "visual guide call";
        gap: 20px;
        align-items: stretch;
    }
    .contact-project-intro { grid-area: intro; padding: 8px 4px 16px 16px; }
    .contact-project-eyebrow { display: block; color: var(--bringer-s-text); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .contact-project-intro h2 { color: var(--bringer-s-heading); font-size: clamp(32px, 4.1vw, 60px); line-height: 1.07; letter-spacing: -.045em; margin: 0 0 22px; }
    .contact-project-intro p { color: var(--bringer-s-text); max-width: 440px; margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
    .contact-project-grid .contact-project-action {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        position: relative;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        min-width: 0;
        min-height: 172px;
        padding: 26px;
        border: 1px solid var(--bringer-s-border);
        border-radius: 20px;
        text-align: left;
        font: inherit;
        text-transform: none;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        text-decoration: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background-color .2s, border-color .2s;
    }
    .contact-project-grid button.contact-guide-trigger { grid-area: guide; scroll-margin-top: 120px; color: #fff; background: #b80046; border-color: #b80046; }
    .contact-project-grid button.contact-guide-trigger:hover { color: #fff; background: #970039; border-color: #970039; }
    .contact-guide-trigger[hidden] { display: none !important; }
    .contact-project-grid .contact-call { grid-area: call; color: var(--bringer-s-heading); background: var(--bringer-s-container-bg); }
    .contact-project-grid .contact-call:hover { color: var(--bringer-s-heading); border-color: var(--bringer-s-heading); }
    .contact-project-arrow { position: absolute; right: 24px; top: 22px; }
    .contact-action-meta { display: block; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 9px; }
    .contact-action-title { display: block; max-width: 160px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
    .contact-project-visual { grid-area: visual; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; min-width: 0; margin: 0; border-radius: 20px; background: #181b21; }
    .contact-project-visual img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 0; min-height: 280px; flex: 1 1 auto; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 40%; }
    .contact-project-visual figcaption { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; color: #e1e2e6; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .contact-project-visual figcaption a { color: #fff; font-size: 12px; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none; min-height: 28px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .contact-project-visual figcaption a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
    .contact-project-direct { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding: 24px 4px 0; }
    .contact-project-direct p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; color: var(--bringer-s-text); }
    .contact-project-direct > div { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; }
    .contact-project-direct a { display: inline-flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; color: var(--bringer-s-heading); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; text-decoration: none; min-height: 44px; }
    .contact-project-direct a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .25em; }
    .contact-project-section :is(a, button):focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--bringer-s-heading); outline-offset: 5px; }
    @media (max-width: 1023px) {
        .contact-project-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) repeat(2, minmax(0, .6fr)); gap: 16px; }
        .contact-project-intro { padding: 4px 0 10px 8px; }
        .contact-project-intro h2 { font-size: 38px; }
        .contact-project-grid .contact-project-action { padding: 22px; min-height: 162px; }
        .contact-action-title { font-size: 20px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
        .contact-project-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-template-areas: "intro intro" "guide call" "visual visual"; gap: 12px; }
        .contact-project-intro { padding: 0 0 14px; }
        .contact-project-intro h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 7.5vw, 44px); }
        .contact-project-intro p { font-size: 15px; }
        .contact-project-eyebrow { font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .contact-project-grid .contact-project-action { padding: 18px; min-height: 162px; border-radius: 16px; }
        .contact-action-title { font-size: 19px; }
        .contact-action-meta { font-size: 10px; }
        .contact-project-arrow { right: 17px; top: 18px; width: 20px; height: 20px; }
        .contact-project-visual { border-radius: 16px; }
        .contact-project-visual img { min-height: 0; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 3/2; flex: none; }
        .contact-project-visual figcaption { padding: 14px 18px; }
        .contact-project-direct { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; padding-top: 20px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .contact-project-grid .contact-project-action { transition: none; } }
</style>
